<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Kilahna</book>
  <para style="h">Kilahna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kilahna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kilahna</para>
  <para style="mt">Kilahna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami pen a sawt lo-a ang tung bai ding, a nasemte tungah a lah dinga Pasien in ama a pieh Jesu Khrist kilahna ahi hi; ama in vantung mite sawlin ama’ nasempa John theisah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />John in Pasien’ thu le Jesu Khris’ teci panna a mu zosie nangawn teci a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua kamsanna thute a ginga a simte mi hampha ahi a, a sunga kigiel thute za-in a zui mite mi hampha ahi hi; azieh pen a hun a nai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />John in Asia gam sunga om hlattuom pawlpi sagite kungah: Tuhun, a tawpsa hun, le mailam huna ang om lai ding pa le ama’ topha mai-a om hlagau sagite pan le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a muonhuoi teci pa, misite lah panin a suoh masa pen, leitung kumpite a uhpa, Jesu Khris tung pan hepina le lungnopna note tungah hing om taheh. Eite ei it a, a sisan ziehin i mawnate panin ei suohtasah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama’ Pa Pasien nasem dinga kumpi le siempu ei suohsah pa tungah a tawntungin minthanna le uhzawhna om den taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />En un! Meiipi tawh ama ang pei hi; mit zosie in ama mu ding a, ama a sun mite nangawnin mu ding uhi; ama ziehin leitung minam zosie a kap ding uhi. Tua bang ang hi ding hi. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhun, a tawpsa hun, le mailam huna ang om lai ding a Vanglien Topa Pasien in, “Keima a kipatna le a tawpna ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu sungah bawlsietna-a kipan kumpi gam ahi a, lungduoina tawh thuohzawhna ahi zongin, note tawh a thuohton na sanggam uh keima John in Pasien’ thu le Jesu’ teci panna ziehin Patmos a kici tuikul ah ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa’ ni-in hlagau-ah omin ka nua lamah pengkul banga a gin ngai mama aw khat ka za a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Na mu teng laibu khatah giel inlen, hlattuom pawlpi sagite ahi Ephesus, Smyrna, Pergamum, Thyatira, Sardis, Philadelphia, le Laodecia-te tungah hlah in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ei hopi awging mu nuomin ka kihei leh kham meivah tunna sagi ka mu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua meivah tunnate laikim ah puontuolpi silin a awm-ah kham awmgah a gah Mihing Tapa tawh a kibang khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lutang le a sam tuumul bangin kangin vua bangin paa hi; a mittangte meikuong kileh tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A keng pen pummei sunga sumngo kihal sieng kinawtval bang a, a awgin pen tui tampi a luongton ging tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A zietlam khutah aahsi sagi tawi a, a kam panin a langni-a a hiem namsau khat pusuoh hi. A maitang sunkim nisa tang pempom tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama ka mu ciengin a keng zungah a si bangin ka pua hi. Ahi vangin ama in ka tungah a zietlam khut hing ngamin, “Zau sin; kei pen a kipatna le a tawpna ka hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a hing zing pa zong ka hi hi. Ka na si ngai a, en in, kumtawn kumtawna a hing zing ka hi hi; keima in Sina le Misi khuo tawhtangte ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu-in na musa nate, tu-a om nate, tam zaw cienga ang pieng lai ding nate zosie giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka zietlam khutah na mu aasi sagite le kham meivah tunna sagite’ thu tami ahi hi: Aasi sagite pen hlattuom pawlpi sagite’ vantung mite ahi a, meivah tunna sagite pen hlattuom pawlpi sagite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ephesus hlattuom pawlpi’ vantungmi tungah giel in: Tam teng pen a zietlam khutah aasi sagi tawi-in kham meivah tunna sagi lahah a vah kawikawi pa’ kammal ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Keima in na nasepte, na gimnate le na thuohzawh hatnate ka thei hi. Nang in sietna bawlte na thuoh zawh lo lam ka thei hi; sawltahpi hi lopi sawltahpi ka hi uhi, a ci mite sittelin a zuou ahi lam uh na munate zong ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima’ min ziehin lungduoi tahin thuohin na cimtah lo lam zong ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle kang mawsahna khat om veve a, tua khu nang in itna masa pen na nuasie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin bang ka ci pua ta ahei ci phawh inlen, kisiakia-in na sil bawl masate bawlkia in. Na kisiakia sih poma leh nangma kungah hing pei-in a opna mun panin na meivah tunna ka hemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanle nang ang kipatatna pen tami ahi hi: Keima in zong ka muda ahi Nicolas pawlte’ nasepna na muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hlagau in hlattuom pawlpite tunga a thugente khu bil nei poma in za taheh. Keima in a guolzo mi zosie tungah Pasien’ paradise sunga a om hinna singkung neh theina thu ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Smyrna hlattuom pawlpi’ vantungmi tungah giel in: A masa pen le a nukhia pen, a si ngaisa le a hingkia pa’ thugen tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nang na hau vangin na gentheina le na zawnna ka thei hi. Jew mi hi lo napi ka hi uhi, ci-in kigenin hizongle Satan’ pawl ahi zawte’ ang gensietna ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na gim thuoh dingte zau vawt sin. Pilvang in, dawimangpa in nang ang ze-et nadingin note kimkhat thong sungah hing khumin ni sawm sung gentheina na thuoh ding uhi. Si tanpha-in muonhuoi in, tua hile keima in hinna lukhu kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpite tunga Hlagau thugen khu bil nei poma in za taheh. A guolzo poma nivei sina in a gimsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pergamum hlattuom pawlpi’ vantungmi tungah giel in: A langni-a a hiem namsau nei pa’ thugen tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Satan’ kumpi topha opna muna a teng na hi lam kang thei hi. Hinanle ka min na pomdet a, Satan opna mun note lahah a kithat ka teci, ka mi muonhuoi pa Antipas khan lai nangawnin kei nei upna na niel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongle na tungah mawsahna themkhat ka nei hi: Nang in milimte mai-ah kithoina ante nesahin numei-pasal pahtatna a bawl nadingun, Israel mite mai-ah suikhah ding na khat koi dingin Balak tunga thu a hil Balaam’ thuhilna a pom mi kimkhat na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n nang in Nicolas thuhilna a pom mi pawlkhat zong na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin kisiakia in. Na kisiakia sih leh na kungah kang naw pei ding a, ka kam sunga namsau tawh amate ka do ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpite tunga Hlagau thugen khu bil nei poma in za taheh. Keima in a guolzo mi zosiete tungah phuolsel manna kimkhat ka pie ding a, suongkang khat le a tunga min tha kigiel khat zong ka pie ding hi. Tua suongkang pen a ngate simlo koima in thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thyatira hlattuom pawlpi’ vantung mi tungah giel in: Meikuong kileh banga mit nei pa le sumngo banga keng nei pa’ thugen tam bang teng ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na gamtatnate- itna, upna, nasepna, le lungduoi taha na thuozawhnate ka thei hi. Na sep masa pen sangin na sep nukhia pen a thupi zawh lam zong ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang tungah mawsah ding thu tami ka nei hi: Nang in numei-pasal pahtatna le milim biehna ante ne dingin ka nasemte hilin a puikhiel, ama le ama kamsang a kici numei Jezebel na kham sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua numei a kisia nading hun ka pieh vangin a numei-pasal pahtatna panin a kisia nuom tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kidawm un, tua nu tawh a pahtatnate uh panin a kisiakia sih uleh, tua numei le ama tawh a pahtat zosie lupna ka ngahsah ding a, gimna lienpi ka thuohsah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuale keima in tua numei’ tate ka satlia ding hi. Tua ciengin hlattuom pawlpite zosie in kei pen lungsim le lungtang a sui pa ka hi lam ei thei ding vua, khat ciet tungah na gamtatna utawh kituohin kang thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanle Thyatira khuo sunga om tami thuhilna a pom lo, mi pawlkhat in, ‘Satan’ thuthuh pite,’ a ci thute zong a sin kha vawt lo no adang teng tungah keima in vangih dang khatpo kang suon sih hi, ci thu kang gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kang pei masangin na neisun teng uh na tukip bembom un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A guolzo le ka nasepna a tawp tanpha-a a zomsuoh mi zosie tungah, keima in minamte tungah thuneina ka pie ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />leibeelte a kisatguoi bangin ama in sia ciengpum tawh amate uh ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />keima zong ka Pa kung panin thuneina nga ka hi hi. Keima in zong a guolzo mi pa tungah zingsol aasi ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpite tunga Hlagau thugen khu bil nei poma in za taheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sardis khuo hlattuom pawlpi’ vantungmi tungah giel in: Pasien’ hlagau sagi le aasi sagi a nei pa’ thugen tam bang ahi hi: “Na nasepte ka thei a, a hing min na puoh vangin a si na hi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khanglo inlen, a si dihtaha om a hing lai mite thakhausah in. Bangzieh ahei cile ka Pasien mai-ah na nasepnate a bucingin ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin na sansa le na zahsa thute phawhkia inlen, tua thute zui-in kisiakia in. Na khahlaw sih leh na kungah guta bangin kang pei ding a, kang pei hun ding na thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle Sardis khuo ah a puonsil uh a niehsah lo mi themkhat na nei lai hi. Amate a kilawm ahi ziehin puonpaa silin kei tawh vah kawikawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na guolzaw leh nang zong amate bangin puonpaa ang kisilsah ding a, hinna laibu sung panin na min ka phiet sih ding hi. Ka Pa mai le ama’ vantungmite mai-ah na min ka pulah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpite tunga Hlagau thugen khu bil nei poma in za taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Philadelphia khuo hlattuom pawlpi’ vantung mi tungah giel in: A siengtho, a thuman pa, David’ tawhtang nei pa, a hon ciengin koima in kha zo loin, a kha ciengin koima in a hon zo lo pa’ thugen tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na nasepnate ka thei hi. En in, koima in a kha zo lo kot honsa khat na mai-ah ka koi hi. Thahatna themno khat beh na nei vangin ka thu zui-in keima’ min na nuol lo lam ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mai-ah Jew mi hi lo napi ka hi uhi, ci-a zuou a gen Satan’ pawlte peisahin na kephungah ka bawhsah ding a, tuaci’n nang kang it lam amate ka theisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungduoi tahin thuohzawhna thu tawh kisai ka thu zui zo na hi ziehin, leitunga teng mite sittel nadingin leitung buppi-a ang tung ding hahsatna hun panin kang kem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima kang pei bai ta ding hi; koima in na kumpi lukhu ang lahpieh lo nadingin na neisate tukip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Guol na zaw leh ka Pasien’ biehinnpi sungah khuompi kang suohsah ding a, tua panin na pusuoh ngai nawn sih ding hi. Ama tungah ka Pasien’ min le ka Pasien kung vantung pana ang kumsuh Jerusalem khuo tha ahi, ka Pasien’ khuopi’ min le keima’ min tha ka giel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpite tunga Hlagau thugen khu bil nei poma in za taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Laodicea khuo hlattuom pawlpi’ vantungmi tungah giel in: Pasien’ siem nate’ a bul, a muonhuoi le a thuman teci ahi Amen’ thugen tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Na nasepnate ka thei hi; vot lah vot lo, sa lah sa loin na om hi. Na vot leh vot kicien inlen, na sat lezong sa kicien vet lacin ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n vot lah vot lo, sa lah sa loin lum lemlem na hi ziehin ka kam sung panin kang sekhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen nang in, ‘Kei ka hau a, ka nuomsa hi. Tasap bangma ka nei sih hi,’ na ci hi. Hinanle a genthei, a hepihuoi, a zawng, a mittaw, le a guohtanga om na hi lam na kithei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na hau thei nadingin kei kung panin mei tawh a kihalsiengsa kham, guohtanga om na hi lam mite ang muna panin na zum sel nadingin na sil ding puonpaa, khuo na mu thei nadingin mitza na lei nadingin thu kang hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima in ka itte phawhsie-in thu ka hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai in! Kotkhah gei-ah dingin kot ka kiu hi; ka aw za a, kot nei hon leh na sungah hing lutin nang tawh an netonin, nang in zong kei tawh an na neton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keimama guolzo-in ka Pa tawh ama’ topha tungah ka toton ma bangin, a guolzo pa zong ka topha tungah keima tawh a toton thei nading mun khat ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpite tunga Hlagau thugen khu bil nei poma in za taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam zaw ciengin ka khuodah leh vantungah kot kihongsa khat ka mu hi! Tuale pengkul tawh a kibang, ei hopi awging ka zah masa pen in, “Tanah hing kato in, tam zaw cienga thupieng dingte kang lah ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thakhatthu-in hlagau in ei luodim a, tuale vantungah kumpi topha khat ang kidaw a, tua kumpi topha tungah mi khat ang to hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khumi kumpi topha tunga a to pa pen jasper le carnelian suongmanpha tawh kibang a, kumpi topha kimvelah emerald suongmanpha tawh a kibang sakhi-guihlung khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua kumpi topha kimvelah kumpi topha sawm ni le li ma om a, tua kumpi tophate tungah puontuol kang silin a lu tung vuah kham lukhu a khu upa sawm ni le li a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua kumpi topha panin tun ang phe a, keh kie-in van ang to vapual a, tuaci’n kumpi topha mai-ah Pasien’ hlagau sagite ahi meivah sagi kivah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpi topha mai-ah crystal suong tawh a kibang le limlang tuipi tawh a kibang khat a om hi. Kumpi topha kimvel le a pang tuohah a nua a ma-ah mittang a dima a nei ganhing li a om hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ganhing masa pen humpi tawh kibang a, a nina pen bawngtang tawh kisunin, a thumna pen in mihing maitang bang nei a, a lina pen a lenglai muvanlai tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ganhing lite in hla guh ciet nei-in, tua a hlate’ kimvel le a sung lamah mittang a dim hi. A sun a zanin khawl loin, “A omsa, tuhun-a om, le ang pei lai ding Vanglien Topa Pasien, Siengtho, siengtho, siengtho hi, ci-in la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ganhingte in kumpi topha tunga a to a hingzing pa tungah minthanna, patawina le lungdamkona a nei sielun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kumpi topha tunga a to a hingzing pa mai-ah tua upa sawmni le lite in khupbawhin a bie uhi. Amate in kumpi topha mai-ah a lukhute uh pai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kote’ Topa le Pasien aw, minthanna, patawina, le vanglietna nga dingin na kilawm hi. Azieh pen sil bangkim na piengsah a, na deina bangin tuate omin kipiengsah hi, ” ci-in la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpi topha tunga a to pa zietlam khutah a sunglam le a pulama kigiel ciemtena sagi tawh kiciemte laiziel khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale a thahat vantungmi khat in, “Tua laiziel a phen ding le a ciemtenate a phel dinga a kilawm koi ahei,” ci-in awging tawh a kiko ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale vantung ahi a, leitung ahi a, leinei ahi zongin tuami laiziel phenin a sung a en thei ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua laiziel a phen ding le a sung a en dinga a kilawm mi koima a kimu lo ziehin nahpi tahin ka kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin upate khat in keima kungah, “Kap sin. En in, David’ Zungpi Judah minam Humpi in laiziel le a ciemtenate a phen thei nadingin guolzo ta hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua kumpi topha le ganhing lite kikal le upate lahah a kigosa tawh a kibang, ki sagi le mittang sagi a nei tuuno a ding khat ka mu a, tuate pen leitung zosie-a kisawl Pasien’ hlagau sagite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama pei-in kumpi topha tunga a to pa’ zietlam khuta laiziel a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua laiziel a lah zaw ciengin tuuno mai-ah ganhing lite le upa sawmni le lite a khupbawh uhi. Amate in mi siengthote’ thungetna ahi harp lasahna khat ciet le panamtui a dima kikoi kham kuong khat ciet a tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in la tha khat, “Laiziel a la ding le a ciemtenate a phen dingin nang na kilawm hi, azieh pen nang ang kigo zo a, Pasien adingin be namcin, ham namcin, mi namcin, minam namcin panin na sisan tawh mite na tan zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ka Pasien uh’ na a sem dingin kumpi za le siempu za na pie zo a, amate in leitung a uh ding uhi,” ci-in a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka khuodah leh kumpi topha, ganhingte le upate kimvela a om vantungmite’ awging ka za hi. A tam dan uh ahile a tul a then ahi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />amate in, “A kigo tuuno khu vanglietna le hauna, pilna le thahatna, patawina, minthanna, le phatna nga dingin a kilawm hi!” ci-in a aw nei za-in la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantung, leitung, leinei, tuipi sung le tuate sunga a om a kipiengsah ganhing zosie in, Kumpi topha tunga a to pa tung le Tuuno tungah phatna, patawina, minthanna le vanglietna om den tawntung taheh!” ci-in la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale ganhing lite in, “Amen!” a ci vua, a upate in zong khupbawhin a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Tuuno in ciemtena sagite lahah khat a phen ka mu a, ganhing lite lah pan khat in vanto ging bangin, “Hing pei in! “ a ci ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka khuodah leh sakol kang khat na om hi! Sakol tunga a tuong pa in thal khat tawi-in ama tungah kumpi lukhu khat kipie a, tuaci’n guolzo pa hina tawh a guolzo dingin ama a kuonkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ciemtena a nina a phen ciengin ganhing a nina in, “Hing pei in! “ a ci ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin sakol san dang khat ang pusuoh hi. Tuale mite khatlekhat a kitha thei nadingun a tunga tuong pa in leitung panin kilemna a lahkhiet thei nadingin thu kipie hi; namsau golpi khat zong kipie lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ciemtena a thumna a phen ciengin ganhing a thumna in, “Hing pei in! “ a ci ka za hi. Ka khuodah leh sakol vom khat na om hi! A tunga tuong pa in tawitena kop khat a khutah tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale ganhing lite laikimah awging tawh a kibang khat ka za a, “Ni khat thaman dingin mangbu quart khat le ni khat thaman dingin mangbu-ham quart thum hi a, ahi vangin oliv thau le lenggazu susie sin!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ciemtena a lina a phen ciengin ganhing a lina in, “Hing pei in! “ a ci ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka khuodah leh sakol kang daang khat na om hi! A tunga tuong pa’ min pen Sina hi a, Misi khuo in ama nua a zui hi. Amate in namsau, kielpi, pulnatna, le gamsate tawh leitung seli-suo-sekhat a tha thei nadingun thuneina kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ciemtena a ngana a phen ciengin maitam nei-ah Pasien’ thu hang le teci a panna hang vua thana a thuoh mite’ hlagau ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in, “A thuman le a siengtho, Thunei pen pa aw, nangma in leitunga a teng mite tungah thukhenin ka sisan phu uh na lah masang bangtan sawt lai ding ahei?” ci-in nahpi tahin a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate tungah puontuol kang khat ciet kipie a, amate a kitha bangin a sawt lo-a kithat lai ding a naseppite ule a sanggamte uh a kim sieng masangsie bakhat sung a khawl phot dingun amate kungah kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ciemtena a guhna a phen ciengin ka khuodah leh, zil nasie tahin ang ling a, ni zong la-ip puon bangin ang vomin, hlapi pen a buppi-in sisan bangin ang san hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huipi a lan ciengin theipuomte a pul sieng bangin vana aasite lei-ah ang kiesuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Laiziel a kizieltum bangin vanpi zong kizielin ang maimang a, muolpi le tuikul zosie a opna mun panin ang kikhinmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin leitung kumpite, miliente, galkapmangte, mihaute, mi thuneite, silate le sila lote a kipanin mi zosie, leikuohawm sung lah le muoltung suongpite lahah a kibu vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tua muolte le suongpite kungah, “Ka tung vuah hing kiesuh un, kumpi topha tunga a to pa’ maitang pan le Tuuno thangpaina panin ei lie un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />azieh pen amau’ thangpaina ni thupi hing tung zo ta ahi ziehin koi in thuoh zo ding ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam zaw ciengin leitung kiuli-a a ding vantungmi li ka mu a, amate in leitung, tuipi tung, le singkung khatpo a mutmang zo lo nadingin tua leitung hui lite a tukon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nisuona lam panin a hingzing Pasien’ ciemtena a nei vantungmi adang khat ang kato ka mu a, ama in leitung le tuipi a suhsiet thei nadinga vanglietna kipiesa vantungmi lite nahpi tahin hlan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate kungah, “I Pasien nasemte’ talpang tungah ciemtena i khet zo masangsie leitung, tuipi, le singkungte susie nai sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuale cieptesa mi phaza a kisim ka za a, Israel mi nam zosie sung panin mi tul za le tul sawmli le tul li cieptesa ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah be panin tul sawm le tul ni, Reuben be panin tul sawm le tul ni, Gad be panin tul sawm le tul ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asher be panin tul sawm le tul ni, Napthtali be panin tul sawm le tul ni, Manasseh be panin tul sawm le tul ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Simeon be panin tul sawm le tul ni, Levi be panin tul sawm le tul ni, Issachar be panin tul sawm le tul ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zebulun be panin tul sawm le tul ni, Joseph be panin tul sawm le tul ni, Benjamin be panin tul sawm le tul ni kiciemte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam zaw ciengin ka khuodah leh mi namcin, be namcin, micin, le ham namcin panin koima’ simzawh lo mihonpi in puonpaa silin, a khut sung vuah lutu na a tawi vua, tuaci’n kumpi topha mai le Tuuno mai-ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nahpi tahin amate awngin, “Hutdamna khu kumpi topha tunga a to i Pasien ule Tuuno-a’ ahi hi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpi topha, upate, le ganhing lite kimvela a ding vantungmi zosie in kumpi topha mai-ah kunin Pasien a bie vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Amen! I Pasien uh tungah minthanna, pilna, lungdam kona, patawina, vanglietna, le hatna om den tawntung taheh! Amen” ci-in la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin upate khat in, “Tami puontuol paa silte koite hi a, hei pana hing pei uh ahei?” ci-in ei dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in, “Siepa aw, a thei nang na hi hi,” ka ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in keima kungah, “Tam mite pen gimna lienpi pana ang pei ahi uhi; amate in a puontuolte uh Tuuno sisan sungah sawp siengin a paasah zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tami ziehin amate Pasien’ topha mai-ah a om vua, sun le zanin a biehinnpi sungah ama’ na a sem uhi. Kumpi topha tunga a to pa in amate a dal ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate gilkiel ngai nawn loin, zong dangta ngai nawn lo ding uhi; nisa in zong ka ngai nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kumpi topha laikima om Tuuno khu amate a cing pa hi ding a, hinna tuinah ah amate a peipi ding hi. Tuale Pasien in a mittang panun hlitui zosie a nulsieng pieh ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuuno in ciemtena sagina a phen ciengin nai lang sung bang vantungah a kisip dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale Pasien mai-a a ding vantungmi sagi ka mu a, amate pengkul sagi kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gimnamtui halna kham kuong a tawi vantungmi adang khat hing pei-in maitam ah ang ding hi; misiengtho zosie’ thungetna tawh kumpi topha mai-a kham maitam tungah a piehton dingin ama tungah panamtui tampitah kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Misiengthote’ thungetna tawh tua vantungmi’ khut sung panin Pasien mai-ah gimnamtui khute a kato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantungmi in tua gimnamtui kuong la a, a sungah maitam panin mei-am a dimin koi-in leitungah a paisuh leh van hing to-in keh ang kie a, tun ang phe-in zil ang ling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin pengkul sagi a tawi vantungmi sagite pengkul mut dingin a baisa-in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A khatna vantungmi in a pengkul a mut leh sisan tawh a kihal giel le mei ang omin leitungah tuate a kisepsuh hi; tuale leitung sethum-suo-sekhat katumin singkung sethum-suo-sekhat zong katum a, lopa zosie zong a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nina vantungmi in a pengkul a mut leh mei in a kah muol golpi tawh a kibang na khat tuipi sungah kipaisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuipi sethum-suo-sekhat sisan suohin tuipi sunga a om ganhing sethum-suo-sekhat si a, tembaw sethum-suo-sekhat kisie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thumna vantungmi in a pengkul a mut leh meila banga a kuong aasi golpi khat vantung panin ang kiesuh a, gunte le tuinahte sethum-suo-sekhat tungah tusuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua aasi’ min Gamsai ahi hi. Tuite sethum-suo-sekhat gamsai tui suoh a, tuami tui pen aicimtangkha a bah ziehin a dawn mi tampitah a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A lina vantungmi in a pengkul a mut leh a tanna uh sethum-suo-sekhat a miel thei nadingin ni sethum-suo-sekhat, hla zong sethum-suo-sekhat ma, le aasi sethum-suo-sekhat kisusie a, tuaci’n sun zong sethum-suo-sekhat miel a, tua ma bangin zan zong sethum-suo-sekhat ma a miel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka khuodah leh vankim lai-ah muvanlai khat a len kawmin, “Adang vantungmi thumte in a mut dinga a kisah uh pengkul gingte ziehin leitunga teng mite tungah, “Gimna, gimna, gimna ang tung ding hi!” ci-in nahpi taha a kiko ka za hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A ngana vantungmi in a pengkul a mut leh van panin lei ah aasi kiesuh khat ka mu a, mong nei lo kuohawm vang honna tawhtang ama kipie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama in tua kuohawm vang ang hong leh meiphuolpi pana meikhu bangin tua a vang panin meikhu ang pusuoh a, tua a vang pana meikhu ziehin ni le van a miel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua meikhu sung panin leitungah kauphete ang pusuoh a, leitungah mom-aite’ thuneina bangin amate thuneina kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitunga a po lopate, sing hingte, le singkung khat popo susie loin, a talpang tung vua Pasien’ ciemtena a nei lote beh susie dingin amate thu kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in tua mite that loin hla nga sung a bawlsiet nadingun phalna kipie a, amau’ thuoh gimna ahile mom-ai in mi a pe cienga a nat bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin mite in sina a sui ding vua, ahi vangin a mu sih ding uhi; a si nuom ding vua, ahi vangin amate kung panin sina a taimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua kauphete’ melpuoh dan pen gal kuon dinga a kivon sakolte tawh kibang hi. A lu tung vuah kham lukhu tawh kibang a khu vua, a maitang uh pen mihing maitang tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sam uh numeite sam bang a, a hate uh humpite’ ha tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sia awmdal tawh a kibang awmdal a nei vua, a hlazap ging uh pen gal sim dinga a tai sakol leeng honpite’ gin tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mom-ai bangin mei nei-in mi de thei a, a mei vuah hla nga sung mite gimsah thei nading gu nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in kumpi-in mong nei lo tua kuohawm a uh vantungmi a nei uhi; a min Hebrew hamin Abaddon kici a, Greek hamin Apollyon kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gimna masa pen tawp zo hi. Gimna nam ni ang tung lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin a guhna vantungmi in pengkul a tum leh Pasien mai-a om kham maitam’ ki li panin awging ka za a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />pengkul nei vantungmi a guhna kungah, “Euphrates gunpi-a kihen vantungmi lite hlakhie in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n mihingte sethum-suo-sekhat a tha ding uh a kum, a hla, a ni, a nai ngaha a baisa-a kikoi tua vantungmi lite a kihlakhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sakol tung tuong galkapte awn zani a pha hi; tuaci’n keima in a mi phaza ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka mangmuna sunga sakolte ka mu dan tam bang ahi hi: Sakol tung tuongte in mei, sapphire suong manpha le kaat mel tawh a kibang awmdalte a sil uh ka mu hi. Tua sakolte’ lutang pen humpite’ lutang tawh kibang a, a kam panun meikuong, meikhu, le kaat a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kam pan vua a pusuoh meikuong, meikhu, le kaat, tam gimna thumte in mihingte sethum-suo-sekhat a thatlia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile sakolte’ vanglietna pen a kam le a mei vuah a om hi. A mei uh pen gul tawh kibangin lutang nei a, a meite utawh mi a liemsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tami gimnate ziehin a si lo a omlai mite in a khut vua a bawl uh nasepte panin a kisia sih vua, dawite le a mu thei lo, a za thei lo, le a pei thei lo kham, ngun, sumngo, le sing le suong milimte a bieh uh a tawp tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A mi thana, a aisanna, a numei-pasal pahtathna, le a guhtatnate uh panin zong a kisia tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale vantung panin a thahat adang vantungmi khat ang kumsuh ka mu a, ama meiipi-in a kituom a, a lu tung sonah sakhi-guihlung khat a om hi; a maitang ni bangin tang a, a kengte meikuong khuompite tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A khut sungah laiziel neu khat phensa-in a tawi hi. Tuipi tungah a zietlam keng nga-in leitungah a veilam keng nga a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />humpi hawh bangin a hawh vapuoh hi. A hawh ciengin vanto sagite aw ang ging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vanto sagite ang gin zaw ciengin kei zong a giel dingin ka kisa leh, “Vanto sagite’ thugente giel sinlen imcip in,” ci-in vantung panin aw khat ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka musa tuipi tung le leitunga a ding vantungmi in, van lamah a zietlam khut lamto-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />kumtawnin a hingzing pa, vantung le a sunga omte, leitung le a sunga omte, tuipi le a sunga omte a siempa tawh kiciem hi: “A kiheh nawn sih ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ahi vangin a sagina vantungmi in a pengkul ang mut ding ni ciengin ama in kamsang ama’ nasemte kungah a tangko ma bangin Pasien’ thusim ang tangtung ta ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantung panin ei kihopina aw khat ka zakia a, “Pei inlen tuipi tung le leitunga a ding vantungmi khut sunga a kiphensa laiziel va la ta’n,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n vantungmi kungah ka pei a, tua laiziel neu ei pie in, ci-in ka gen hi; tuale ama in keima kungah, “Tami la inlen ne in; na gilpi sungah ang kha ding a, hinanle na kam sungah khuoizu bangin ang hlum ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n vantungmi khut sung panin tua laiziel neu la-in ka ne hi; ka kam sungah khuoizu bangin hlum a, ahi vangin ka neh zaw ciengin ka gilpi a khasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in keima kungah, “Nang in mi tampite, minamte, ham tuomtuomte, le kumpite tawh kisai genkholnate, na genkia pelmaw ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ciengkhut tawh kibang tena cieng khat ei kipie a, “Hing pei-in Pasien’ biehinnpi le maitam te inlen, biehinnpi sunga om a bie mite zong sim in,” ei kici hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ahi vangin biehinnpi pulam tuol pen te sinlen nuasie in; azieh pen tua khu minam dangte’ khut sunga a kipiesa ahi a, amate in khuopi siengtho hla sawmli le hla ni sung a tuoncil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka teci nite la-ip puonpi silin ni tulkhat zani le sawmguh sung thugen theina ka pie ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua teci nite pen leitung Topa mai-a a ding oliv singkung nite le meivah tunna nite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale mi khatpo in ama gel a suhsiet nop leh a kam sung panun meikuong pusuohin a galte katum ding a, ama gel susie nuom popo tam bangin kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thugen hun sungun ama gel tungah guo a zuh lo nadingin van a khacip nading thuneina, tuite sisan suosah thei nading thuneina, a dei hunhunun gimna namcin tawh leitung a suhsiet thei nading thuneina kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau’ teci panna a man zaw ciengin a mong nei lo kuohawm pana ang kato gamsa in tua teci pangte gel simin zogawpin that ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale ama gel’ luonghawm pen a Topa uh zong singlamte tunga a kikhaina mun khuopi lampi tungah kisiel ding hi, tua khuopi’ minhem pen Sodom le Egypt kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Be le phung, kamham, le minam zosie panin mite in ni thum le alang sung amau’ luonghawm a en ding vua, hankhuh sunga a kivui ding a phal sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami kamsang nite in leitunga tengte tungah bawlsietna a tunsah ziehun ama’ gel sina hangin leitunga tengte thangpha-in pawi bawlin khatlekhat letsong a kipie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin ni thum le a lang zaw ciengin ama gel sungah Pasien’ hu lutin, a keng-un ang ding vua, tuaci’n ama gel a mu mite a zau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama gel in, “Tanah hing kato ta gel in!” ci-in vantung panin awging ngai khat a za uhi. Tuale a galte uh’ mitmu-in meii tung tuongin vantungah a kato ta gel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin nasie tahin zil ang ling a, khuopi sesawm-suo-sekhat cimguoi-in zil a lin ziehin mi tul sagi si a, adang teng zausi-in vantunga om Pasien a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gimna nina tawp zo ta hi. Gimna a thumna ang tung bai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantungmi sagina in a pengkul a mut leh vantungah aw ngai mama khat ang ging a, Leitung kumpi gam pen i Topa ule ama’ Messiah-a’ suoh zo a, ama in kumtawnin uh zing ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien mai a topha ciet vua a to upa sawmni le lite a mai vuah kunin Pasien a bie vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tulai tahin a om, a om ngaisa, Vanglien Topa Pasien aw, lungdam kang ko uhi, azieh pen nang in na vanglietna lienpi na la zo a, gam uh dingin na kipan zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Minamte a thangpai vua, hinanle na lungthahna ang tung zo ta hi. Misite tunga thukhen ding hun le, na nasem kamsangte, na min a zatah na misiengtho a neu a lien in, patah man pieh ding hun le, leitung a susie mite a kisuhsiet ding hun ang tung zo ta hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantunga om Pasien’ biehinnpi kihong a, tua biehinnpi sungah thuciemna singkuong kimu hi; tuale tun ang phe a, van ang to-in keh ang kie a, zil ang lingin gielpi ang kie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vantungah a gol lim lamdang khat ang kilang a, numei khat in puon sil bangin ni silin a keng nei-ah hlapi koi a, a lu tungah aasi sawm le ni tawh a kizem kumpi lukhu a khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua numei pen a gai ahi a, nau suoh natna in a tut ziehin na sa-in a peng vagua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantungah lim lamdang adang khat ang kilang leuleu hi: gulhiempi a san a gol mama khat in lutang sagi le ki sawm nei-in, a lu tungah kumpi lukhu sagi khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mei in vantunga aasite sethum-suo-sekhat kaikhie-in tua teng leitungah kikhiesuh hi. Tua ciengin nau a suo lien cienga a neh thei nadingin nau suoh kuon numei nu mai-ah tua gulhiempi a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Numei ang suoh a, sia ciengkhut tawh minam zosie a uh ding ta pasal khat ang nei hi. Ahi vangin a tapa kila-in Pasien le a topha tungah kipeipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni tul le zani le sawmguh sung a kiva dingin Pasien in a bawlpiehsa mun khatah tua numei nu a tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vantungah gal kidona ang om hi; Michael le ama’ vantungmite in gulhiempi a do uhi. Tua gulhiempi le vantungmite in zong a dokia vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ahi vangin gal lel uh ahi ziehin vantungah amate adingin mun a om nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A gol mama gulhiempi, dawimangpa le Satan a kici leitung buppi a sol pa, tanglai gulpi lei ah kikhiesuh hi, ama pen a vantungmite tawh kikhiesuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantungah aw ngai mama khat ka za a, “Tu-in i Pasien’ hutdamna, a vanglietna, a gam le ama’ Messiah thuneina ang tung zo ta hi. Azieh pen i Pasien mai-ah i kithuopite sun le zana mawsah pa kikhiesuh zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hizongle amate in Tuuno sisan zieh le amau’ teci panna thu ziehin ama a zo uhi. Azieh pen amate in sina a thuoh dongun a nuntahna nangawn uh a it sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hi a, no vantungte le a sunga tengte aw, kipah un! Ahi vangin leitung le tuipi in gimna a thuoh ding uhi, azieh pen dawimangpa in a hun a tom lamtah a thei ziehin lungthahna lienpi tawh na kung vuah ang peisuh hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n gulhiempi in leitungah ama a kikhiehsuh zo lamtah a thei bepin ama in ta pasal a nei numei ang del hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua gulpi kung panin suohta-in hun khat, hunte, le hun lang sung a kiva nading ama’ mun ahi gamlahah a len thei nadingin a gol mama muvanlai’ hla ni tua numei kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuikhang in numei a tawmang thei nadingin gulpi in a kam panin guntui bangin numei nu’ nua lamah tui a luongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin lei in numei nu panpi a, a kam kahin tua gulhiempi in a kam pana a pusuoh guntui a hupkang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin numei tungah gulhiempi thangpai a, Pasien’ thupieh a pomte, Jesu’ teci panna a pomte, le a omlai numei’ suonlehlahte sim dingin a kuonkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuipi gei-a senel tungah gulpi a ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale ki sawm le lutang sagi a nei gamsa khat tuipi pana ang pusuoh ka mu hi; a kite tungah kumpi lukhu sawm omin, a lutangte tungah Pasien gensietna minte a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ka gamsa mu pen kamkei tawh kibang a, a kengte vompi-a’ tawh kibangin, a kam humpinelkai’ kam tawh kibang hi. Tuale gulhiempi in a vanglietna, a kumpi topha, le a thuneina lienpi ama a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lutang khat in si nading za dongin liemma nei leh kilawm a, hinanle tuami si thei nading liemma pen damkia zo hi. Leitung bup in lamdangsa-in tua gamsa nua a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gulhiempi in tua gamsa tungah thuneina a pieh zo tah ziehin amate in ama a bie vua, “Gamsa tawh a kibang koi om a, koi in ama do zo ding ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kiphatsahna le Pasien gensietna kammalte a gen nadingin tua gamsa tungah kam khat kipie a, a thuneina a zah hun ding hla sawmli le hla ni sung kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Pasien a gensie dingin a kam kah a, ama’ min le ama’ tenna le vantunga a tengte zosie a gensie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Misiengthote tungah galbawlin a zaw nadingin zong phalna kipie hi. Ama tungah phung namcin, micin, ham namcin le minam cin kipie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />leitung piencil a kipanin a kigosa Tuuno’ hinna laibu sunga a min kigiel lo ahi leitunga teng mi zosie in ama a bie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zah nading bil nei a koimapo in ngai un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saltang dinga ang kikai leh saltang ding ma-in na pei ding hi; namsau tawh mi na tha leh namsau ma tawh ang kithat ding hi. Tam sungah misiengthote’ thuohzawh na le upna kalh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin leitung pana ang pusuoh gamsa dang khat ka mu hi; ama in tuuno bangin ki ni nei a, gulhiempi bangin a ham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in amasa gamsa tangin thuneina zosie zang a, leitung le a sunga tengte in a si nading liemma a damsa tua gamsa masa pen a biesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a lien a lamdang limte bawl a, mi zosie’ mu-in vantung pan leitungah mei nangawn a kiesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in amasa gamsa tanga a kibawlsah lim lamdangte tawh leitunga a tengte sol a, namsau tawh a liemsa hi napi a hingkia ahi gamsa’ lim khat a bawl nadingun amate thu a pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua gamsa’ lim a ham thei nading le gamsa’ lim a bie lote a kitha thei nadingin tua gamsa’ lim sungah hu kimop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a neu a lien, a zawng a hau, sila le sila lo, mi zosiete a zietlam khut ahi sihle a talpangah a ciemtesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n gamsa’ min ahi sihle a min’ nambat ahi ciemtena a nei lo poma in van lei thei loin zong zua thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami thu-ah pilna a kisam hi: Pilna a nei poma in tua gamsa’ nambat tuot taheh, bangzieh ahei cile tua pen mi khat’ nambat ahi hi. Tua nambat pen zaguh sawmguh guh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka khuodah leh Zion Muol tungah Tuuno a dingin na om hi! A talpang tung vua ama’ min le a pa’ min a kigiel mi tul za le tul sawmli le tulli zong ama tawh a omton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale tui tampi ging bang le vanto ging tawh a kibang a ginngai mama aw khat ka za hi. Tua ka zah awging pen harp tumte in a harp lasahna uh a tum cienga awging tawh kibang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate in kumpi topha mai, ganhing lite mai, le upate mai-ah la tha khat a sa uhi. Leitung pana a kitankhiesa mi tulza le tul sawmli le tul lite ci simlo koima dang in tua la sa thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam mite ahile numei tawh a bua ngai nai sih uhi, azieh pen amate tangval ahi uhi; tam mite in Tuuno’ peipeina ah a zui kawikawi uhi. Amate Pasien le Tuuno adingin a ga masa pente ahi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a kam sung vuah zuouthu kici kimu loin paubanna a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin leitunga a teng mi namkim, be namkim, le mi zosie kungah kumtawn lungdamna thu phuongzah dinga van kimlai-a a leng vantungmi dang khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nahpi tahin ama kiko a, “A thukhen nading hun ang tung ta ahi ziehin Pasien giing unlen, ama phat un; van le lei le tuipi le tuinahte a siem pa ama bie un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nina vantungmi dang khat in ei zui a, “Cim ta, a lien mama Babylon khuopi cim ta! Ama nu in a numei-pasal pahtatna tawh a kipawl lungthahna lenggazu minam zosie a dawnsah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin a thumna vantungmi dang khat in amate zui-in aw lienpi tawh, “Tua gamsa le a lim bie-in a talpang tung uh ahi sihle a khut tung vuah ciemtena khat a nga mite in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien’ thangpaina hai sungah bangma tawh kihal lo-a kisung Pasien’ lungthahna lenggazu zong a dawn ding vua, amate pen a siengtho vantungmite mai le Tuuno mai-ah meikuong le kaat tawh kibawlsie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amau’ kibawlsietna meikhu kumtawnin a kitungto valuh hi. Gamsa le a lim a bie mite le tua gamsa’ min ciemtena a nga tapo adingin sun ahi a, zan ahi zongin tawlngahna himhim a om sih hi,” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami sungah Pasien thupieh a zui mite le Jesu’ upna a pom misiengthote’ thuohzawhna kalh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale vantung panin aw khat ka za a, “Tami giel in: Tu-a kipan Topa sunga a site mi hampha ahi hi,” a ci hi. Hlagau in, “Hi hi,” a ci a, “A sepnate un amate nuazui ding ahi ziehin a nasep gimna uh panin a tawlnga ta ding uhi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka khuodah leh meiilum kang khat na kai a, tua meiilum kang tungah Mihing Tapa tawh a kibang mi khat to-in, kham lukhu khat khu a, a khut sungah phieukawi hiem khat a tawi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biehinnpi panin vantungmi dang khat ang pusuoh a, meiilum kang tunga a to mipa nahpi tahin hlanin, “Leitung an lah hun ang tung zo ta ahi ziehin na phieukawi zang inlen at in, azieh pen leitunga ante min siengin kuotgawp ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n meiilum tunga a to mipa in leitungah a phieukawi a vat kawikawi leh leitung atsa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin biehinnpi panin vantung-mi adang khat ang pusuoh a, ama in zong phieukawi hiem khat ma nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin mei tunga thunei vantungmi dang khat maitam panin ang pusuoh a, phieukawi hiem tawi mipa nahpi tahin hlanin, “Lenggate min zo ta ahi ziehin na phieukawi hiem zang inlen, leitung lengga gui panin lengga bawhte khawm in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n vantungmi in leitungah a phieukawi a vat kawikawi a, lenggate khawmin Pasien’ thangpaina lengga cilna phuolah a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khuopi pulamah lengga kicil a, tua lengga cilna phuol panin sisan luongin, tai zani bang a gamlatna dongah sakol kamkai cieng banin a luong hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantungah a cizat huoi le a lien mama lim dang khat ka mu a, tua khu a nukhia pen gimna nam sagi a tawi vantungmi sagite ahi uhi, azieh pen amate tawh Pasien’ thangpaina a tawp ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale mei tawh a kihal limlang tuipi bang dan khat ka mu a, gamsa le ama’ min le ama’ nambat tunga guolzote in a khut vuah Pasien’ lasahna harp-te tawi-in tuipi limlang gei-ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in Pasien’ nasem Moses’ la le Tuuno’ la a sa uhi: Vanglien Topa Pasien aw, na nasepte lienin cizat a huoi hi! Minamte’ Kumpipa aw, na lampite thumanin thutang hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa aw, koi in nang hing giing loin, na min hing phat lo ding ahei? Azieh pen nang beh na siengtho hi. Na thukhennate kilah zo ahi ziehin minam zosie hing pei-in nangma mai-ah ang bie ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin ka khuodah leh vantunga teci panna puonbuh ahi biehinnpi honsa-in om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />biehinnpi sung panin gimna sagi tawh vantungmi sagite ang pei vua, a vam lihleh saihadiel puon silin kham kawnggah tawh a awm a gah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin ganhing lite sung panin khat in vantungmi sagite, kumtawna a hingzing Pasien’ thangpaina a dim kham hai sagi a pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale Pasien’ minthanna le a vanglietna panin meikhu in biehinnpi sung teng dim a, vantungmi sagite’ gimna sagi a ven masangsie tua biehinnpi sungah koima lut thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin biehinnpi panin a gin ngai mama aw khat in vantungmi sagite kungah, “Pei unlen leitungah Pasien’ thangpaina hai sagite va buo ta un,” a ci ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n vantungmi amasa pen pei-in leitungah a hai a buosuh leh gamsa ciemtena a nei le ama’ lim a bie mite tungah a kidahhuoi hima huoisie a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vantungmi a nina in tuipi tungah a hai a buosuh leh tua tuipi pen misite’ sisan tawh kibang a, tuipi sunga a om hinna a nei ganhing zosie a sigam sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vantungmi a thumna in gunte le tuinahte tungah a hai a buosuh leh tuate sisan a suoh sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale tuite’ a uh vantungmi in, “Nang tulaitaha om, a omsa, Siengtho Pa aw, tam thu teng na khen ziehin nang na thutang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />amate in mi siengthote le kamsangte’ sisan a luonsah ziehun, a thuoh ding vua a kilawm bangin a dawn ding uh sisan na pie zo hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale maitam in, “Hi hi, Vanglien Topa Pasien aw, na thukhente manin thutang hi!” ci-in a dawnkia ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vantungmi a lina in ni tungah a hai a buosuh leh, ni in amate mei tawh a halgawp thei nadingin phalna kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sa mama mei in amate lieu gawp a, hizongle amate in tam gimnate tunga thunei ahi Pasien’ min a gausam vua, kisiakia nuom loin ama a phat nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vantungmi a ngana in gamsa’ kumpi topha tungah a hai a buosuh leh ama’ gam teng khuo a miel hi; mite in na a sah ziehun a lei uh a pet vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuale a thuoh uh natnate le a himate ziehun van Pasien a gausam vua, a gamtatna uh panin a kisia tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vantungmi a guhna in Eupharates gun golpi tungah a hai a buosuh leh nisuona lam panin kumpite peina lam siel khol dingin tua tui a gawkang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale gulhiempi’ kam sung, gamsa’ kam sung, le zuou thei kamsangpa’ kam sung panin ukeng tawh a kibang a gilo hlagau thum ang pusuoh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamte pen na lamdang bawl dawite’ hla ahi a, leitung buppi-a om kumpite kungah pei-in, Vanglien Pasien’ ni thupi ni-a gal do dingin amate a kaikhawm dinga kuon ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />(“En un, guta bangin kang pei ding hi! A guohtangin pei-in a muolpho lo nadingin khanglo zing a, puon a sil pa pen thupha nga ahi hi,” a ci hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hebrew hamin Harmagedon a kici munah amate in kumpite a khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vantungmi a sagina in huilahah a hai a buosuh leh biehinnpi sung kumpi topha panin aw ngai mama khat ang ging a, “Man zo hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale tun ang phe a, van ang to-in keh ang kie a, nahpi-in zil ang lingin gielpi ang kie hi. Leitunga mite a opzaw a kipanin tua bang zil linna a om ngai nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuopi lien khen thum kisuo-in, minamte’ khuopite a cimmang hi. Pasien in a lien mama Babylon a phawh a, ama’ lungsona lenggazu-hai ama a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuikul zosie taimang siengin muolte kimu nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Van panin mite tungah pound zakhat ta a gih giel golpite kiesuhin, gielpi gimna ziehin amate in Pasien a gausam za ding dongin tua gimna zauhuoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin hai sagi a tawi vantungmi sagi hing pei-in keima kungah, “Hing pei in, tuipi tampite tunga a to a lien numei pahtat nu tunga thukhenna kang lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung kumpite in ama nu tawh pahtatna a bawlton vua, leitunga teng mite in amau’ pahtatna lenggazu a kham uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in hlagau tawh gamlahah ei puomang a, lutang sagi le ki sawm a nei, gensietna minte tawh a kidim a sandup gamsa tunga a to numei khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua numei in a sandup le a ausan puonte silin, kham, suongmanphate le tui kepte tawh kizem a, a kidahhuoi nate le a pahtatna a niehte tawh a kidim kham hai khat a khutah a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale a talpang tungah: “A lien Babylon khuopi, numei pahtatte le leitunga a kidahhuoi nate’ nu,” ci-in a thuthuh min khat kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua numei in misiengthote’ sisan le Jesu tunga teci a pang mite’ sisan khamin a om ka mu hi. Keima in tua nu ka mu ciengin lamdang ka sa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle vantungmi in keima kungah, “Bang dinga lamdang na sah ahei? Tua numei le lutang sagi le ki sawm a nei, ama nu a puo gamsa tawh kisai thuthuh na kungah kang gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua na mu gamsa pen nidangin om ngai-in tu-in om nawn lo hi., mong nei lo lei kawhawm panin a pusuoh dingin ang kisa a, tuale sietna thuoh dingin a pei ding hi. Tua gamsa pen om ngai zo a, tu-in om nawn lo napi ang peikia ding ahi ziehin leitung kisiem cila kipanin hinna laibu sunga a min a kigiel kha lo leitunga teng mite in tua gamsa a mu ciengun lamdang a sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tami thu-ah lungsim pilna kisam hi: Lutang sagite pen tua numei nu tona muol sagite ahi hi; kumpi sagite zong ahi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuate lahah nga pua zo a, khat om lai a, adang khat pen ang pei nai lo hi; ama ang pei ciengin bakhat sung beh kip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khatvei a omsa, tu-in a om nawn lo gamsa pen kumpi gietna hi napi, kumpi sagite-a’ zong hi vanuh a, tuaci’n ama sietna ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mu ki sawmte pen kumpi gam a nga nai lo kumpi sawmte ahi vua, hizongle amate in tua gamsa tawh kumpite bangin nai khat sung thuneina a nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua teng kithutuohin a vanglietna ule a thuneina uh tua gamsa tungah a pie uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />amate in Tuuno a do ding vua, Tuuno in amate a zo ding hi, azieh pen ama topate’ Topa le kumpite’ Kumpipa ahi a, ama tawh a omton mite ahile a kihlansa, a kiteelsa, le a muonhuoi mite vive ahi uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale ama in keima kungah, “Na musa tua numei pahtat nu tona tuite pen mite, mihonpite, minamte, le ham namcinte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na musa ki sawmte le tua gamsa in numei pahtat nu a muda ding uhi; amate in tua nu’ neisa zosie lahpiehin a guohtangin a omsah ding vua, a sa ne-in mei tawh a haltum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien’ kammalte a tangtun masangsie, ama’ lungtup a sem dingin kithukimin tua gamsa tungah a kumpi gam uh a pieh nadingun Pasien in amate lungsim sungah tua thu koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua na mu numei pen leitung kumpite a uh khuopi lien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami zaw ciengin vantung panin thuneina lienpi a nei vantungmi dang khat ang kumsuh ka mu hi; ama’ thupina tawh leitung a salvah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama nahpi tahin kiko a, “A lien Babylon khuopi kicim, kicim! Dawite’ tenna mun suoh zo ta a, hlabua zosie’ zuolna mun, a nieh va namcin’ zuolna mun, a kidahhuoi le a mudahuoi gamsa namcin’ zuolna mun suoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen ama’ pahtatna zieha thangpaina zu khu minam zosie in a kham zo ta vua, leitung kumpite in ama nu tawh pahtatna a bawl vua, leitung sumbawlte in tua nu’ nopsahna a haulaw uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin van panin awging dang khat ka za a, “Ka mite aw, a mawnate sungah kihalin, a gimnate na thuohpi lo nadingun, tua nu kung panin hing peikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen tua nu’ mawnate in vantung banin kiciengto a, Pasien in ama nu’ khielnate, a phawh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama nu in note ang bawl bangin ama nu tungah zong bawl unlen, ama nu’ gamtatnate a za ni-in thuhkia un; ama in a hal hai sungah ama adingin a za ni-a a cia zu halpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama le ama kisielin a noptat zaza, bawlsietna le dan a ama nu pie un. Ama nu in a lungsim sungah, ‘Kumpi nu bangin ka uh hi; kei meigong ka hi sih a, dana ka thuoh ngai sih ding hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ni khat thu-in ama nu gimnate ahi, pul natna, kaana, le kielpi- ang tung ding a, mei tawh ama nu kihaltum ding hi. Azieh pen ama nu thu a khen Topa Pasien a vanglien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama nu tawh pahtatna bawlin a noptatton ahi leitung kumpite in a kihalna meikhu a mu ciengun ama nu kaa-in a mau ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ama nu’ thuohna giingin a gamlapi-ah a ding ding vua, “Kadei, kadei, khuopi lien, a vanglien khuopi Babylon! Nai khat sungin na tungah thukhenna ang tung zo hi,” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leitung sumbawlte da-in ama nu a kaa ding uhi, azieh pen a summet bawlna vante ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kham, ngun, suong manphate, le tuikepte, saihadiel puon, a ausan, nai puon le puon sandupte, sing namtui namcin, saiha tawh a kibawl na namcin, a manpha singgai namcin, sumngo, sia le, suongngo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />cinnamon sing namtui, gimnamtui, halnamtui, myrrh panamtui kha, panamtui, lenggazu, oliv sathau, bawnghon le tuuhon, sakol le sakol leengte, silate, le mihing nuntahnate koima in lei nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kung panun na lunggul uh gate peimangin, sil tuituoh le sil thupi zosie maimang ta a, kimu ngai nawn lo ding hi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua nu kung panin a nga uh tami vante tawh a hau sumbawlte in ama’ thuohna ziehin amate zau-in gamlapi ah dingin da-in nahpi-in a kap ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kadei, kadei, saiha diel puon, puon ausan le puon dupsante silin, kham, suong manphate, le kep suongte tawh a kizem ngai khuopi lien!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam haunate zosie nai khat sungin a maimang dawh ta’n! a ci uhi. Tuale tembaw uhte zosie, tembaw tawh khuolzinte, tembaw nasemte, tuipi tunga summet bawlte zosie gamlapi ah dingin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ama nu kihalna meikhu a mu ciengun, “Tami khuopi tawh a kibang bang khuopi om ahei?” ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kaa a mau kawmun a lutung vuah leivui the-in, “Kadei, kadei, tuipi tunga tembaw nei zosie in ama nu citheina zieha a haulaw uh, khuopi lien khu! Nai khat sungin a maimang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vantung le no mi siengthote, sawltahpite, le kamsangte aw, ama nu ziehin kipah un, azieh pen Pasien in ama nu tungah note adingin thukhenna pie zo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin a thahat vantungmi khat in an gawina suong tawh a kibang suong golpi khat la-in tuipi sungah sepsuh a, “Babylon khuopi lien khu tam bangin nahpi-in kisepsuh ding a, a kimu nawn sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />nang sungah harp lasahna gingte, lasate’ awgingte, theile tumte awging le pengkul gingte, kiza nawn lo ding hi; na sungah khutsiem nasemte khat zong kimu nawn loin, na sungah an gawina gingte kiza nawn lo ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />na sungah meivah zong a kivah nawn sih ding a, na sungah mopi pa le motha nu’ awging kiza nawn lo ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile na sumbawlte uh, leitunga miliente ahi vua, na ai utawh mi nam zosie a kisolmang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangma sungah kamsangte, mi siengthote, le leitunga thana a thuoh zosie’ sisan kimu zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami zaw ciengin vantungah mihon tampite’ awging tawh a kibang khat ka za a, Hallelujah! Hutdamna, minthanna, le vanglietna eite’ Pasien-a’ ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />azieh pen ama’ thukhennate thumanin thutang hi; ama in a pahtatna tawh leitung a siesah numei patat nu tungah thukhen zo a, ama’ nasemte’ sisan ziehin ama nu tungah phu a la zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in khatvei, “Hallelujah! Ama nu’ kihalna meikhu kumtawnin a kato hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Upa sawmni le lite le ganhing lite kunin kumpi topha tunga a to Pasien a bie vua, “Amen, Hallelujah!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpi topha panin aw khat ang ging a, “No a nasemte zosie, no ama a zatah a neu a lien in, i Pasien phat un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in tui tampi gin le a gin ngaih keh kieh tawh a kibang mi honpite’ awging bang khat ka za a, “Hallelujah! Azieh pen a vanglien i Topa Pasien in a uh zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eite in lungdam kipahin ama i phat ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile Tuuno mopi hun ang tung ta a, kithawisa-in a monu om zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama tungah a sieng le a vam lihleh saihadiel puon kipie zo hi,” a ci uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile saihadiel puon pen mi siengthote’ gamtatna dihte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale vantungmi in keima kungah, “Tami giel in: tuuno mopi pawi-a a kihlan mite mi hampha ahi hi,” ei ci hi. Tuale ama in keima kungah, “Tamte pen a thuman Pasien’ kammalte ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama bie dingin a ke phungah ka bawh a, hinanle ama in kei kungah, “Tam bang bawl sin! Kei pen nang le Jesu teci panna a pom na kithuopi mite tawh na semton ka hi bo hi. Pasien bie zaw’n! Bangzieh ahei cile tua Jesu’ teci panna pen kamsanna’ lungsim ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin vanpi ang kihong ka mu a, sakol kang khat a om hi! A tunga tuong pa min pen a Citah le a Thuman kici a, ama in dihna tawh thukhenin gal a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mittangte meikuong bang a, a lutungah kumpi lukhu tampitah khu hi; ama simlo koima in a thei lo min khat ama tungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in sisan sunga a kidie puontuol sil a, ama’ min pen Pasien’ Thu kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vantung galkapte in a siengtho le a vam saihadiel puon a sil vua, sakol kangte tungah tuongin ama a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minamte a satpai dingin a kam sung panin namsau hiem khat ang pusuoh a, ama in sia ciengkhut khat tawh amate a uh ding hi; vanglien Pasien thangpai-in a lungsona ahi lengga suhna ama in tuoncil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a puontuol tung le a phei tungah, “Kumpite’ kumpipa le tote’ Topa ,” ci-a kigiel min nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin ni sunga a ding vantungmi khat ka mu a, ama in aw ngaitah tawh vankimlai-a leng va zosie hlanin, “Hing pei un, a thupi Pasien’ nitah ankuong luina ah hing kikhawm unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kumpite’ sa, galkapmangte’ sa, mi thahatte’ sa, sakolte le a tunga tuongte’ sa- mi zosiete’ sa, suohta mi le silate a kipanin a neu a lien zosiete’ sa ne dingin hing kikhawm un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin sakol tunga tuong pa le a galkapte sim dinga amau’ galkapte a kaikhawm gamsa le leitung kumpite ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua gamsa le ama opna munah na lamdangte bawlna tawh gamsa ciemtena a nga mite le ama’ lim a biete a sol kamsang zuoupa tawh ama a kiman ton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A omlai teng pen sakol tunga tuong pa’ kam sung pana a pusuoh namsau in that sieng a, va zosie in amau’ sa khamtahin a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantung panin vantungmi khat hing kumsuhin a khutah mong nei lo kawhawm honna tawhtang le siakhau golpi khat a tawi ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Dawimangpa le Satan a kici tanglai gulpi ahi gulhiempi manin kum tulkhat sung hencip a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kuohawmpi sungah sepsuhin kum tulkhat a tawp masangsie minamte a sol nawn lo nadingin tawh kilin ama tungah a ciemte hi. Tua zaw ciengin bakhat sung ama kihla ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpi tophate ka mu a, tuate tunga a tote tungah thukhen nading aana kipie hi. Jesu tunga teci panna le Pasien’ thu zieha ngawngtanna a thuohte’ hlate zong ka mu hi. Amate in gamsa ahi a, a lim ahi zongin bie loin, a talpang tung vuah ahi a, a khut tung vuah ahi zongin gamsa ciemtena zong a nga sih uhi. Amate ang hingkia vua, Khris tawh kum tulkhat sung a mangton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />(Kum tulkhat a tawp masangsie a omlai misite a hingkia nai sih uhi.) Tami pen thawkiana masa pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thawkiana masa sunga a kihalte pen mi hampha le mi siengthote ahi uhi. Tua mite tungah nivei sina in thu a nei nawn sih a, tuale mahin amate pen Pasien le Khris’ siempute ahi ding vua, ama tawh kum tulkhat sung a mangton ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum tulkhat a tawp ciengin a thongkiehna panin Satan kihla ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gog le Magog kici lei kiuli-a minamte sol dingin kuonkhie ding a, a galsimpi dingin amate a kaikhawm ding hi. Amate ahile tuipi gei-a senel za-in a tam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitung maitang dimin amate a kuon vua, misiengthote’ giephuol le a it a khuopi a kimkot uhi. Tuale vantung panin meikuong ang kiesuhin amate a haltum sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate a sol dawimangpa pen gamsa le kamsang zuou pa opna mun, kaat le meilipi sungah kikhiesuh a, tuaci’n amate sun le zanin kumtawn bawlsietna kithuohsah den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin a lien kumpi topha kang khat le a tunga to pa ka mu hi; ama opna mun panin leitung le vantung taimang a, ama gel adingin mun kimu zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale kumpi topha mai-a a ding a sisa a lien a neu ka mu a, tuaci’n laibute zong kiphen hi. Hinna laibu ahi laibu dang khat zong kiphen hi. A sisate tungah a gamtatnasate uh laibu sunga kiciemte tawh kizui-in thu kikhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuipi in a sunga om misite puohto-in, Sina le Misi khuo in zong amate sunga om misite hing puohto a, a sepnasa uh tawh kizui-in a unpi-un amate tungah thu kikhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin meilipi sungah Sina le Misikhuo kikhiesuh hi. Tami meilipi pen sina nina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinna laibu sunga a min kigiel kha lo poma tua meilipi sungah kikhiesuh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin van tha le lei tha khat ka mu hi; azieh pen van masa le lei masa mangmai zo a, tuipi zong a om nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Motha khat a pasal adingin a kizemsa-in a kithawi bangin vantung Pasien kung panin ang kumsuh khuopi siengtho ahi Jerusalem tha ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale kumpi topha panin awging ngai khat ka za a, “En in, mihingte lahah Pasien’ inn a om ta hi. Amau’ Pasien ahi dingin amate tawh ama a tengton ding hi; amate pen ama’ mite hi ding a, Pasien mama amate tawh a omton ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama in amau’ mit panin a hlitui zosie uh a siapieh ding hi. Sil masate maimang zo ahi ziehin, Sina kici a om nawn sih ding hi; dana, kaana, le natna cite zong om nawn lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale kumpi topha tunga a to pa in, “En in, sil bangkim a tha-in ka bawl hi,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Tami thute muontahin thuman ahi ziehin giel in,” ei ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in keima kungah, “Kizo ta hi! Kei pen Alpha le Omega, a kipatna le a tawpna ka hi hi. Keima in a dangta mite tungah hinna tuinah panin tui a hlawn-in ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A guolzo mite in tami nate luo ding a, tuaci’n kei pen amau’ Pasien ka hi ding a, amate, keima’ tate ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin a meipuote, upna nei lote, a lampielte, tuolthatte, numei-pasal pahtatte, aisante, milim biete, le zuou thugen zosiete om nading mun pen sina ahi kaat tawh kihalna mun meilipi sung hi ding a, tua pen sina nina ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nukhia pen gimna sagite a dima om hai sagi a tawi vantungmi sagite sung panin khat hing pei-in keima kungah, “Hing pei in, Tuuno’ zi ahi motha nu kang lah ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale hlagau tawh a gol mama muol sangpi khatah ei peipi a, vantung Pasien kung pana ang kumsuh a siengtho Jerusalem khuopi ei lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua khuopi in Pasien’ minthanna vang nei-in, a tanna dan pen a cieu mama suongmanpha le Jasper suongmanpha tawh kibang a, crystal suongmanpha bangin sieng kilkel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A gol mama kul sangpi nei a, tunkot sawm le ni nei-in, tua tunkotte ah vantungmi sawm le ni om a, tunkotte tungah Israel minam sawm le nite’ min kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nisuona lamah tunkot thum, leilu lamah tunkot thum, leitaw lamah tunkot thum, nitumna lamah tunkot thum ci bangin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua khuopi kulpi in suong tawpha sawm le ni nei a, tuate tungah Tuuno sawltahpi sawm le nite’ min a tuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ei hopi vantungmi in khuopi le a tunkotte, a kulpite te nadingin kham a kibawl tena ciengpum khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua khuopi in ning li nei a, adung avai kikim hi; tuale ama in a ciengpum tawh tua khuopi a te leh, tai tul le tai zanga pha hi; adung avai le a sanna kikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a kul zong te a, vantungmi in mihing te banga a te ahi a, tong za le tong sawmli le tong li a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kul pen Jasper suongmanpha tawh kilam a, a khuopi pen kham citah tawh kilamin limlang bangin sieng kilkel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuopi kul suong tawphate pen suongmanpha namcin tawh kizem hi; a masa pen Jasper suongmanpha hi a, a nina sapphire, a thumna agate, a lina emerald,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a ngana onyx, a guhna carnelian, a sagina chrysolite, a gietna beryl, a kuona topaz, a sawmna chrysoprase, a sawm le khatna Jacinth, a sawm le lina amethyst suongmanphate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale tunkot sawm le nite pen tuikep suong sawm le ni tawh kibawl hi a, tunkot khatta pen tuikep suong khatta ma tawh kibawlin, khuopi lampi pen kham citah tawh kibawl hi a, limlang bangin a pailetin kimu thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua khuopi sungah biehinnpi ka mu sih hi, bangzieh ahei cile Vanglien Topa Pasien le Tuuno pen tua khuopi’ biehinnpi ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pasien’ minthanna vang pen ama’ khuovah hi a, a meivah zong Tuuno hi zo ta ahi ziehin tua khuopi tanvah dingin ni tang le hla tang zong a kisam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama’ khuovah tawh minamte lam a pei ding vua, leitung kumpite in zong tua khuopi sungah a minthanna uh ang peipi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sun lai-in tua khuopi tunkot kikha ngai lo ding a, khum munah zan hun kici a om ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mite in tua khuopi sungah minamte’ minthanna le patawinate ang peipi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua sungah a siengtho lo bangma lut thei lo ding a, a kidahhuoi le zuouphuote khatpo zong lut thei loin, Tuuno hinna laibu sunga a min kigielte beh lut thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantungmi in Pasien le Tuuno topha pana ang luongkhie, crystal suongmanpha banga a cim kilkel hinna guntui ei lah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua pen khuopi lampi laikimah a luongsuh hi. Tua gun pang tuohah ga nam sawm le nam ni a nei hinna singkung po a, hla sielin ga hi; tua singkung a tete pen minamte damna ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khum munah samsiet mi koima kimu kha nawn lo ding hi. Ahi vangin tua sungah Pasien le Tuuno’ topha om ding a, a nasemte in ama a bie ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />amate in ama’ maitang a mu ding vua, a talpang tung vuah ama’ min a tuong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zan hun ci om nawn lo ding a, Pasien pen amau’ khuovah hi ta ding ahi ziehin amate in meivah tang le ni tang kisam nawn loin kumtawnin a mang den ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Tami thute pen muontah a, thuman ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile kamsangte hlagau ahi Topa Pasien in a nasemte tungah ang tung bai ding thute a lah dingin a vantungmi a sawl zo hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“En in, kang pei bai ta ding hi! Tami laibu sunga kamsanna thute a zui pa mi hampha ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima John pen tami thute za-in a mu pa ka hi hi. Tuate za-in ka mu ciengin keima kunga tuate ei lah vantungmi kephungah a bie dingin ka bawhsuh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ahi vangin ama in keima kungah, “Tam bang bawl sin! Nang le kamsang na kithuopite tawh nasemton khat ka hi bo hi. Pasien bie zaw’n!” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale ama in keima kungah, “A hun ang nai ta ahi ziehin tami laibu sunga kamsanna thute khacip sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sietna bawlpa in bawl lai hinlen, a niehte nieh lailai-in, midihte dih suoh hinlen, a siengthote siengtho suoh ta uheh,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“En in, kang pei bai ta ding hi! Mi zosie a gamtatna uh tawh kizui-in a thuhkia dingin keima kungah ka thaman a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei pen Alpha le Omega, amasa pen le a nukhia pen ka hi a, a kipatna le a tawpna zong ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinna singkung nei thei nading le tunkotte panin khuopi sung lut nading thu nei thei nadinga a puontuol uh a sawpsiengte mi hampha ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pulamah uite, bum tawite, numei-pasal pahtatna bawlte, tuolthatte, milim biete, le zuouphuo nuomsa-in zuouthu gente zosie a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Keima Jesu in hlattuom pawlpite ading tami teci panna thu na kunga ang gen dingin ka vantungmi kang sawl hi. Keima pen David’ zungpi le a suon ahi, zingsol ka hi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hlagau le motha in “Hing pei ta’n,” a ci uhi. Tuale a za zosie in, “Hing pei ta’n,” ci ta uheh. A dangta zosie hing pei uheh. A dei zosie in hinna tui a hlawn-in hing la uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima in tami laibu sunga kamsanna thu a za zosie kang hilkhol hi: Mi khatpo in tuate a belap leh Pasien in zong tami laibu sunga kigielsa gimnate tua mipa tungah a belap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi khatpo in tami kamsanna laibu sunga thute a lahkhiet leh, Pasien in zong tami laibu sunga kigielsa ahi hinna singkung le khuopi siengtho sunga tua mipa nga ding satanh a lahpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tami thute teci a pang mipa in, “Kang pei bai tahtah ta ding hi,” ei ci hi. Amen. Topa Jesu aw, Hing pei ta’n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Misiengtho zosiete tawh Topa Jesu’ hepina hing om taheh. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
